{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/701451-pan-and-bell-how-would-you-do-it","id":701451,"title":"Pan and Bell, how would you do it?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-10-14T17:33:45-07:00","id":701451,"title":"Pan and Bell, how would you do it?","content":"Hi, I recently picked up Changeling and a couple players of mine want to play both as characters but what would be the best way to replicate them? What Kiths? Also , is there a way to be tiny as Bell? Thanks for any suggestions and help.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8508-phaide","name":"Phaide","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"14"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-14T18:39:45-07:00","id":701495,"title":"","content":"Old School Wizened with the Small-Framed Merit and Wyrd...7,8, something like that, with Equinox Road's Wyrd Evolution rules? Lived at Size 3, translated into an exceptionally small child. The Contract of Mirrors had a clause that allows to shrink even further, but that's at a time limit. Of course, one could play as a Hedgebeast Companion(I had some serious fun as a familiar in Ascension, once), so there's that, with a handy Mask to seem like a butterfly or moth or something.<br /> <br /> As for how to convert that as player characters, it would depend on how you read them and which system you used. For Peter in Second Edition, I would give him a seeming of Beast, and a kith that helps bring out egocentrism. For Tink, There's a touch of Darkling or Elemental, and I see no reason to dual kith for Bright One and Sandharrowed. But it depends on your reading.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-14T19:46:11-07:00","id":701575,"title":"","content":"For Tinkerbell, her Kiths could be Bright One and <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/620401-new-kith-feedback-requested\"><b>Weescamperer</b></a>. I'd treat the fairy dust as something generated by a 5 dot Token in the form of a pouch or leather sack. Pan's egocentric Kith could be <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1mZpz1PhV2jzc2ihda1IwHZc_WTrWTv5qbNv4vzcU2-4/edit?pli=1\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Playmate</b></a>, as Arc pointed out. His skill with his namesake flute and mimicry could be granted by the Minstrel and Thusser Kiths, or Contracts like the 2nd clause of Vainglory in 1ED. He could have something like a combination of the &quot;Long Of Days&quot; and &quot;Age Reversal&quot; Merits, which makes him ageless at the cost of never growing up.<br /> <br /> On a related note, many people who read the original stories as adults see something of a sociopath in both Pan and Tinkerbell. It is totally possible to interpret Pan as a Gentry and Tinkerbell as a loyal hobgoblin, perhaps an unusual Spright (Autumn Nightmares, page 135) or related &quot;species&quot; thereof. Pan would be an Actor, Neverland would be his Realm, and the wondrous denizens who look different to every visitor would be a Wisp. Captain Hook might be a rival Gentry.<br /> <br /> Granted, Gentry are rarely used as PCs, and for good reason. However, Pan as a changeling might be close to Becoming Nightmare, as described in Equinox Road.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-15T07:42:24-07:00","id":702079,"title":"","content":"Or you could play it as Pan from the Once Upon a Time series: Changeling that is trying to become True Fae.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/744-korusef","name":"Korusef","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar744_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"510"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-15T07:50:07-07:00","id":702085,"title":"","content":"What if Tinkerbell is the True Fae and Pan is a changeling she took as a kid and groomed out of &quot;love&quot;... until the boy grows up and becomes too old for Tinker 's tastes and must be replaced for another &quot;Pan&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2411,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2411-raistlin","user":"Raistlin","date":". 10-15-2015, 04:04 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2411-raistlin","name":"Raistlin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"713"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-15T07:57:17-07:00","id":702124,"title":"","content":"I don't think he could do Playmate. Playmate's all about playing nice with one another, Pan....doesn't do that.<br /> <br /> Namely because Pan <i>is</i> something of a sociopath.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":99,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","user":"ArcaneArts","date":". 10-15-2015, 11:04 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-15T10:07:20-07:00","id":702285,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/701451-pan-and-bell-how-would-you-do-it?p=702124#post702124\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't think he could do Playmate. Playmate's all about playing nice with one another</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't know that &quot;playing nice&quot; is quite the vibe I got from Playmate. For my part, it feels more like a Kith with whom the Gentry would love to play games. Which, given the sorts of games the Gentry might find fun, feels like a Playmate could easily come out feeling kinda...<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Namely because Pan <i>is</i> something of a sociopath. </div> </div> </div>Well, like that. Playmates are good at cooperating with and working with others, but the ends toward which they're cooperating and working can be all sorts of fucked up.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://avatarcomic.net/exalted-wiki/Exalted_3E:What_We_Know\" target=\"_blank\">The EX3 What We Know Wiki</a>, courtesy of Marin and JMobius<br /> <a href=\"http://nishkriya.com\" target=\"_blank\">Nishkriya, the EX3 Freelancer Quotes Tracker</a>, courtesy of Anathema and Moonwolf<br /> <a href=\"http://forums.whitewolfarchive.com/\" target=\"_blank\">The White Wolf Forum Archive</a>, courtesy of The Dark Wizard and Sanctaphrax (see <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/PhilippeSaner?u=159709\" target=\"_blank\">its Patreon</a>) <hr />Arrghus: There's also the Shepherd of the North Star, busily guiding the one thing in all the heavens that <i>doesn't move</i>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/558-gaius","name":"Gaius","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2028"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-15T10:24:51-07:00","id":702294,"title":"","content":"These are great suggestions! Thanks for the help. It's always nice to talk to people who know their stuff.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8508-phaide","name":"Phaide","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"14"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}